{title: Chehra Hai Ya Chaand Khila Hai}
{artist: Saagar Kishore Kumar R D Burman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [E],        Chehra Hai Ya Chand Khila Hai
[Am],        Zulf Ghaneri Shaam Hai Kya
[G],        Saagar Jaisi Aankhon Vaali
[Am],        Ye To Bataa Tera Naam Hai Kyaa
[Am] [E],        Tu Kya Jaane Teri Khaatir
[Am],        Kitna Hai Betaab Ye Dil
[Am] [E],        Tu Kya Jaane Dekh Raha Hai
[F] [Am],        Kaise Kaise Khwaab Ye Dil
[Am],        Dil Kehta Hai Tu Hai Yahaan To
[Am] [E],        Jaata Lamha Tham Jaaye
[A] [D],        Waqt Ka Dariya Behte Behte
[G] [Am],        Is Manzar Mein Jam Jaaye
[Am] [E],        Toone Deewana Dil Ko Banaaya
[Am],        Is Dil Par Ilzaam Hai Kya
[G],        Saagar Jaisi Aankhon Vaali
[Am],        Ye To Bataa Tera Naam Hai Kya...
[Am] [E],        Aaj Maein Tujhse Door Sahi
[Am],        Aur Tu Mujhse Anjaan Sahi
[Am] [E],        Tera Saath Nahin Paaun To
[F] [Am],        Khair Tera Armaan Sahi
[Am],        Ye Armaan Hain Shor Nahin Ho
[Am] [E],        Khamoshi Ke Mele Hon
[A] [D],        Is Duniya Mein Koi Nahin Ho
[G] [Am],        Hum Dono Hi Akele Hon
[Am] [E],        Tere Sapne Dekh Raha Hoon
[Am],        Aur Mera Ab Kaam Hai Kya
[G],        Saagar Jaisi Aankhon Vaali
[Am],        Ye To Bataa Tera Naam Hai Kya...
